# No cache-busting query strings

Browser caching is disabled. Do not add `?v=` (or any other cache-busting query) to script, stylesheet, module, or asset URLs.

```js
import { player } from "./player.js";
image.src = new URL("../assets/images/baker/baker_still.png", import.meta.url).href;
```
